<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 21-24.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 21-24.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for March</p>
<p>21-24 at 1100GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons</p>
<p>to a German mark.</p>
<p>March 21-24  March 20/21</p>
<p> CZK	0.45936	0.45909</p>
<p> DKK	2.09804	2.09592</p>
<p> FIM	2.67529	2.65662</p>
<p> HUF	0.0765	 0.0763</p>
<p> JPY	0.10961	0.1092</p>
<p> LTL	3.38315	3.35054</p>
<p> LVL     23.25204     23.1273</p>
<p> RUR	0.00237	0.00234</p>
<p> SEK	1.77021	1.74966</p>
<p> UAH	7.34285	7.28889</p>
<p> USD     13.5292	13.3988</p>
<p> XEU     15.51055     15.47226</p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
